João Alves Sampaio, Silvia Cristina Alves França, and Paulo Fernando Almeida Braga, editors. Tratamento de Minérios: Práticas Laboratoriais. CETEM/MCT, Rio de Janeiro, 2007, 570 pages. ISBN 978-85-61121-02-0. [Official repository and authorized full text](https://mineralis.cetem.gov.br/handle/cetem/544) · [Publisher download](https://www.cetem.gov.br/antigo/livros/item/download/87_f587879c7450c3d5ed9c5c6ef9f29079).

Read the full manual and complete the relevant laboratory/pilot studies with appropriate material, instrument, and professional guidance. Explain sample preparation, method, calibration, balances, variability, and scale-up limits. A supplied-data interpretation is distinct from performing the laboratory operation.

Official indexed metadata and publisher/technical citations verify the editors, year, length, and ISBN; the repository returned 502 during a direct check. Preserve actual edition/component rights and later method revisions. Access and metadata checked on 29 October 2026. All manual/media/data remain external references.

